        "heading": "The Overcoat, measured flat",
        "table_caption": "Garment measured flat in centimetres, not body measurements",
        "note": "<p>Every product page carries its own table, taken from that garment’s graded sample. Lay a garment you already wear flat and compare — it is more reliable than measuring yourself.</p>"
      }
